---
import { url } from '../utils/base';
---

<section class="my-16 p-8 md:p-12 rounded-xl bg-exo-secondary border border-exo-border relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
    <div class="lg:col-span-8 space-y-4">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded bg-exo-card border border-exo-border text-xs font-mono text-exo-primary">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-exo-primary"></span>
        RESEARCH PHILOSOPHY
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white leading-tight">
        "I don't just summarize what happened. I investigate how it happened, why it happened, and what we can learn from it as engineers."
      </h2>

      <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        Cyber Exorcist is a personal technical publication. As a computer engineer navigating the cybersecurity discipline, I deconstruct notable cybercrime incidents, software vulnerabilities, and digital forensic records to understand the real engineering mechanics behind digital attacks.
      </p>

      <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-xs font-mono">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-200">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-exo-primary" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12" />
          </svg>
          Dual Narrative &amp; Technical Analysis
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-200">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-exo-primary" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12" />
          </svg>
          Primary Source Blockchain &amp; Court Data
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-200">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-exo-primary" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12" />
          </svg>
          Actionable Defensive Telemetry
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="lg:col-span-4 flex justify-center lg:justify-end">
      <a
        href={url('/about')}
        class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-lg bg-exo-card hover:bg-exo-cardHover border border-exo-border hover:border-exo-primary text-xs font-mono text-slate-200 hover:text-white transition-all flex items-center gap-2"
      >
        <span>Read Our Methodology</span>
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-exo-primary" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7" />
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
